{%- comment -%}
  Veloura logo lockup — emblem (V monogram) + VELOURA wordmark.
  Rendered as an image (assets/veloura-logo.png) in the header in place of
  the plain shop name. The PNG has a light cream background; CSS uses
  mix-blend-mode: multiply so it blends into the cream header.
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="veloura-logo">
  <img
    class="veloura-logo__img"
    src="{{ 'veloura-logo.png' | asset_url }}"
    alt="{{ shop.name | default: 'Veloura' | escape }}"
    width="1774"
    height="887"
    loading="eager">
</span>
